// LBASIC - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

10 REM Locomotive BASIC. PRINT alone prints in upper case, so
10 PRINT "HELLO WORLD!"
20 POKE -1989,12: REM switch the character generator to lower
30 GOTO 10
RUN
